The '''Dryrock Valley''' is a valley located in western [[Gilneas]], in the shadow of [[Gilneas City]]. Within the valley, royalist forces answering to the Regent-Lords of Gilneas operate lumber and mining industries, putting slave labor to work in the [[Dryrock Pit]] and the [[Dryrock Mine]].

